{"items":[{"id":"ancient-alchemy","slug":"ancient-alchemy","name":"远古炼金术","english":"Ancient Alchemy","kind":"enchantment","categoryKey":"enchantments","dbKind":"reference","image":"./images/effects/enchantments-ancient-alchemy.png","description":"使用生命药水时会获得额外灵魂。即使满血也可以使用药水。","parameters":[["可用部位","靴子、胸甲、头盔、护腿"]],"source":"https://www.dungeons.tools/2/enchantments/ancient-alchemy","subtype":"附魔","iconKind":"enchantment","detail":"./data/database/items/enchantments-ancient-alchemy.json?v=modern1"},{"id":"artifact-amplifier","slug":"artifact-amplifier","name":"法器增幅器","english":"Artifact Amplifier","kind":"enchantment","categoryKey":"enchantments","dbKind":"reference","image":"./images/effects/enchantments-artifact-amplifier.png","description":"使用法器时会获得“驭器”状态，缩短法器冷却时间，同时提高法器伤害和灵魂收集量。","parameters":[["可用部位","靴子、胸甲、头盔、护腿"]],"source":"https://www.dungeons.tools/2/enchantments/artifact-amplifier","subtype":"附魔","iconKind":"enchantment","detail":"./data/database/items/enchantments-artifact-amplifier.json?v=modern1"},{"id":"barrier-brew","slug":"barrier-brew","name":"屏障药剂","english":"Barrier Brew","kind":"enchantment","categoryKey":"enchantments","dbKind":"reference","image":"./images/effects/enchantments-barrier-brew.png","description":"使用生命药水会生成泉水，使你和盟友获得“强固”状态，以抵御敌人攻击。即使满血也可以使用药水。","parameters":[["可用部位","靴子、胸甲、头盔、护腿"]],"source":"https://www.dungeons.tools/2/enchantments/barrier-brew","subtype":"附魔","iconKind":"enchantment","detail":"./data/database/items/enchantments-barrier-brew.json?v=modern1"},{"id":"bottomless-brew","slug":"bottomless-brew","name":"无尽药剂","english":"Bottomless Brew","kind":"enchantment","categoryKey":"enchantments","dbKind":"reference","image":"./images/effects/enchantments-bottomless-brew.png","description":"获得额外生命药水使用次数。","parameters":[["可用部位","胸甲"]],"source":"https://www.dungeons.tools/2/enchantments/bottomless-brew","subtype":"附魔","iconKind":"enchantment","detail":"./data/database/items/enchantments-bottomless-brew.json?v=modern1"},{"id":"buddy-bre